<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72775" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀκρίβας</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῐ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αντος</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄκρις,
			βαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>platform</i> or <i>tribune</i> in the Odeum at Athens, on
			which the actors appeared at the Proagon, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				194b
			</span></i> ; but expld. as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λογεῖον ἐφ᾽ οὗ
				οἱ τραγῳδοὶ ἠγωνίζοντο,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόθορνος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				6.11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>VS</u>
				1.9.1
			</span></i> : in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>VA</u>
				5.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				26.316d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Ner.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> generally, 
				like
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιλλίβας</span>
			, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>painter's easel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				7.129
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>raised seat of the chariot-driver,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> dub. sens., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερθέντων ὀκρ[ίβαντα]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12(8).261
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Thasos</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>ass</i> or <i>wild goat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
